# DuoLinux kernel fragment — Retroid Pocket Duo (eliza / Q-7790)
# Applied on top of arch/arm64/configs/defconfig from RetroidPocket/linux v7.3.
# Symbols that do not exist in a given tree are ignored by merge_config.sh.

